# The site's own address, origin plus any subdirectory it is served from, with
# no trailing slash. Only used to turn the link-preview paths in index.html
# into absolute URLs, which is what Open Graph requires — a relative one is
# ignored by every scraper.
#
# Keep it in step with BASE_PATH: on GitHub Pages a project site lives under
# /<repo>/, so both carry that segment.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://kreobuddha.github.io/ganna-portfolio
